 "remarks": "What if you could own a 2BR/1.5BA townhome in Norwalk for less than $400k? Welcome to Northwood Condominiums. Tucked back on a peaceful, established residential stretch of Strawberry Hill Avenue, this intimate boutique enclave is designed for buyers who prioritize privacy, low-density quiet, and long-term value. Inside, hardwood floors lead to the main level, anchored by a bright, beautiful kitchen. Upstairs, the primary suite is a true retreat with a generous walk-in closet, while your private outdoor patio offers a quiet sanctuary for alfresco relaxing and effortless entertaining. Tightly held and rarely available, Northwood units offer rapid access to Metro-North, I-95, and local shopping. Boutique communities with low turnover don't stay under the radar for long. Experience the Northwood lifestyle for yourself!",
